// Template for a world map voice line, a VC2 stream song (Documentation/Features/VoiceActedIntros.md).
// Replace every [AUDIO_FILENAME] with the line's name, put the line's WAV in the chapter's music/wav/ under that name,
// include this file from the chapter's music/installer.event, then run `make assign_voice_songs` and
// `python3 Tools/voice/vc2.py gen-wm --keep` (it encodes music/vc2/[AUDIO_FILENAME].vc2 and rewrites this file).
// Source: wav/[AUDIO_FILENAME].wav

SongTable(AUTO,[AUDIO_FILENAME],0) // Run assign_voice_song_ids.py to pick an unused song-table ID
